    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d472">

                <pb facs="0656" n="648" xml:id="pg648"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.94/2471</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        President Roosevelt
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-11-24">November 24,
                        1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>There is attached for your consideration a draft of a message to the British
                    Prime Minister<anchor n="78" xml:id="d472-f1"/> containing a description of a
                    proposal for a <hi rendition="#italic">modus vivendi</hi> made by the Japanese
                    Government to this Government and of a suggested alternate <hi
                        rendition="#italic">modus vivendi</hi> which this Government proposes to
                    offer to the Japanese Government.</p>
                <p>If you approve of the draft telegram, I shall arrange to have it
                        forwarded.<anchor n="79" xml:id="d472-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d472-f1" n="78" xml:id="d472-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 5392, <hi rendition="#italic">infra.</hi>
                </p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d472-f2" n="79" xml:id="d472-f2-content">
                <p>President Roosevelt’s notation: “OK. See addition. FDR”. For addition, see close
                    of telegram, <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
